  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Support to Streamlining the Anti-corruption Law Enforcement and Prosecution Institutions in the Republic of Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, with Deutsche Gesellschaft f&#xfc;r Internationale Zusammenarbeit, has the goal to support Government of Moldova in defining the mandate and competencies of law enforcement and prosecution institutions to fight corruption at all levels. Based on the overall goal, the project encompasses the following specific objectives: 
1.	The length of investigation and prosecution of corruption cases undertaken by state anti-corruption institutions is reduced due to a clear division of competencies. 
2.	There is an annual increase in the number of applications for mutual legal assistance executed and sent by Moldovan public prosecutors.</narrative>
  </description>
